摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"deepseek harness 2D and 3D CAD plugin","id":"gh:1340230123","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-cad","slug":"LAU-MARS/dsh-cad","topics":["agentic-ai","cad","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"deepseek harness 2D and 3D CAD plugin"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-cad — CAD Plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A CAD plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh):\nan **embedded 3D/2D CAD viewer** plus a **native parametric"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" modeling tool family**\n(OCCT kernel) in the Web UI, letting the agent build and inspect CAD geometr"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"y\nstep by step — \"model while you watch\"."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A full modeling session, end to end: the agent builds a parametric assembly\nfrom plain chat — a 120×"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"80×8 base plate with R5 rounded corners, then four\nbolt instances placed at the corners — while the "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"resident CAD panel tracks\nevery step live (parts tree with per-instance colors, ViewCube, \"装配体\"\nasse"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"mbly tab, 5 instances · 1,740 triangles). The finished assembly exports\nas a structured STEP documen"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"t and the agent verifies it by reading the file\nback — 2 solids, 3 products, 2 assembly usages, 1,12"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" agent verifies it by reading the file\nback — 2 solids, 3 products, 2 assembly usages, 1,125.00 mm³:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Downloads"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Cumulative downloads from the npm registry, refreshed daily by CI:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Feature Overview"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| ⚙️ Kernel chain: cadorange → occt.ts | Modeling goes through **cadorange** (the agent-native CAD r"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"untime wrapping the occt.ts/OCCT WASM; public API + the supported `cadorange/occt` escape hatch for "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"meshing/HLR/wire construction); the direct occt.ts adapter stays as the fallback tier — `DSH_CAD_KER"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"NEL` pins one explicitly (the opencascade.js tier was removed in v0.15.1, −64MB install). The old \"n"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"o editing after shell\" seam is gone — fillet/chamfer/boolean keep working after shelling |\n| 🔍 CAD v"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"iewing | STL / OBJ / STEP / IGES / BREP / DCPRT (3D), DXF / SVG (2D); interactive viewport in the re"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"sident right panel (orbit / zoom / wireframe / pan), with a one-line result row in the conversation "},{"id":"p11s8","text":"|\n| 🌗 Dark-mode surfaces | Every rendered surface follows the host theme — viewport slab, DXF/drawin"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"g strokes, the Three.js grid / XYZ triad / feature edges / default mesh color / sketch overlays, and"},{"id":"p11s10","text":" the ViewCube plate; a theme flip restyles mounted viewers live. Overrides: `--dsh-cad-bg`, `--dsh-c"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"ad-stroke`, `--dsh-cad-paper` |\n| 🧭 CAD editor interactions | Onshape-style ViewCube (26-zone click-"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"to-orient), hover/click face & edge picking with live measurement (area mm² / length mm), Faces+Edge"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"s / Faces / Wireframe render modes, switchable BRep demo parts (bracket / flange / shaft) |\n| 🏗️ Par"},{"id":"p11s14","text":"ametric modeling | Primitives, profile extrusion, **loft**, **sweep**, **revolve**, booleans, all-ed"},{"id":"p11s15","text":"ge fillet/chamfer, **shell**, **draft**, **patterns** (linear/circular), transforms; profiles take *"},{"id":"p11s16","text":"*curve segments** (arcs/circles exact BRep; B-splines sampled approximation) — exact OCCT BRep, not "},{"id":"p11s17","text":"a mesh approximation. `cad_loft` sections accept **curves** too: point loops, `{through}` splines or"},{"id":"p11s18","text":" planar `{profile}` chains; `smooth: true` fits a **periodic B-spline** through point loops — one co"},{"id":"p11s19","text":"ntinuous B-spline lateral face instead of planar strips meeting at G0 creases |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The plugin is published to npm — one line:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The installer applies the bundled `cordis.patch.yml` (declared in the `dsh.bundle` manifest) automat"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ically, so there is nothing to configure by hand."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Version requirements"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Node.js** and **dsh CLI** (`@deepseek-ai/dsh`): minimum versions live in\nthe badge row above and"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" the `engines` field of `package.json` — kept out of\nthe prose so they never go stale"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Two workers**: import (occt-import-js, read-only STEP/IGES/BREP) and modeling\n(cadorange over th"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"e occt.ts wasm) are separate, both lazily started\n- **Zero-copy pipeline**: modeling scenes use zero"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" base64 / zero large JSON arrays /\nzero per-step disk writes (disk mirror debounced 1.5s, replayed o"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"nly on service\nrestart); `cad_export` is the only explicit file export\n- **Modeling document**: `<wo"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"rkspace>/.dsh-cad/model.json` operation log; all bodies\nare restored by replay after a restart\n- **D"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"rawing HLR kernel**: hidden lines run on **occt.ts** (npm dependency,\n`npm i occt.ts`) — true OCCT r"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"emoval, no fallback engine, a missing kernel is\na hard error. Kernel APIs: `hiddenLines()` true hidd"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"en-line\nremoval, byte-level STEP/BRep `readStep`/`readBrep`/`writeStep`/`writeBrep`\nwithout MEMFS, t"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"essellation with built-in feature-edge extraction, and a\n`hasError()`/`lastError()` error contract. "},{"id":"p20s10","text":"Geometry crosses kernels as STEP\nbytes and the projected segments are remapped into the sheet frame."},{"id":"p20s11","text":" Kernel\ndist resolution: `DSH_OCCTJS_DIST` env var → Node's own resolution of the\n`occt.ts` dependen"},{"id":"p20s12","text":"cy (walks up every parent node_modules — npm/yarn flat and\npnpm symlink layouts all hit) → `<repo>/."},{"id":"p20s13","text":"./opencascade-ts/dist` (sibling\ncheckout) → `vendor/` → `node_modules/opencascade-ts`\n- **Constraint"},{"id":"p20s14","text":" solving (Ansatz)**: the solver is the npm dependency\n**`ansatz-wasm`** (a wasm-bindgen build, singl"},{"id":"p20s15","text":"e package ~538KB, zero deps) —\ninstalling dsh-cad pulls it automatically, and `npm install ansatz-wa"},{"id":"p20s16","text":"sm` alone\nupgrades it. **No Rust toolchain, no native binary, platform independent.**\nResolution: th"},{"id":"p20s17","text":"e npm package (node_modules) → a `DSH_ANSATZ_WASM` directory → a\nsibling Ansatz checkout's pkg-node."},{"id":"p20s18","text":" The solver speaks one JSON envelope\ncontract, with tool-layer errors (e.g. `unsupported_constraint`"},{"id":"p20s19","text":") surfaced\nverbatim for the LLM. Assembly placements (translate + XYZ Euler\ndegrees) map bidirection"},{"id":"p20s20","text":"ally to the solver's rigid3 poses (translate +\nexponential-map rotation, radians). Solver capability"},{"id":"p20s21","text":" is staged\n(point-distance-to-origin today) — the plumbing contract is finished and needs\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Known Limitations"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- DWG (closed-source) is unsupported; DXF bulge arcs are approximated by chords;\nglTF/3MF viewing is"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" not implemented (the structure is reserved)\n- `cad_fillet` is all-edge constant-radius (per-edge se"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"lection is unstable under\nembind); chamfer is not implemented\n- Sketch extrusion supports polygon pr"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"ofiles only (arc profiles are constructed by\nboolean combinations of cylinders/tori)\n- dsh framework"},{"id":"p22s5","text":" limitation: an already-mounted single slot (the right-side details\npanel itself) does not respond t"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"o components registered later, so the persistent\nview is provided as the \"3D\" view tab (a list slot,"},{"id":"p22s7","text":" the official composition)\n- The host reads CAD files via node:fs (the platform fs service supports "},{"id":"p22s8","text":"UTF-8 text\nonly and cannot carry binary data)"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
